abstract: >-
  A deterministic local 2D stick-figure animation and multi-scene movie engine
  with an 18-tool stdio Model Context Protocol (MCP) server, 106 runtime
  actions, 55 geometric props, 6-axis perceptual critique, and SVG/HTML/GIF/MP4/transparent
  WebM export.
